---
import Project from "../../layouts/Project.astro";
---

<Project>
  <h2 class="text-center mb-2">Websocket RFC implementation</h2>

  <p>
    This project is dedicated to implementation of
    <a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6455">Websocket RFC</a>
    as a programming exercise.
  </p>
  <p>
    Tested with
    <a href="https://github.com/crossbario/autobahn-testsuite">
      Autobahn Testsuite
    </a>.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/wmdanor/websocket">Repository</a>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Go</h3>

  <p>Implementation of Websocket server and client in Go.</p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/wmdanor/websocket/tree/main/go">
        Repository folder
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://websocket.wmdanor.com/autobahn/reports/servers/index.html"
      >
        Server test results
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://websocket.wmdanor.com/autobahn/reports/clients/index.html"
      >
        Client test results
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</Project>
